  "decision_zh": "关闭固定全局 DCT 四频带表示内的有限 projection-weight/Pareto 调权路线。v134 比 v133 多通过 238 个单元，但仍为 0/5 完整轨迹；1109 个失败全部只在 observation。相机稀疏和 p45/p58 形态比噪声类别或扰动强度更能解释尾部。下一步只检验一个严格包含 v133、保持变机位与排列不变性的局部空间-频率表示；容量全过以前不训练网络。",
  "decision_en": "Close finite projection-weight and Pareto retuning inside the fixed global four-band DCT representation. v134 passes 238 more cells than v133 but still reaches 0/5 complete trajectories; all 1,109 failures remain observation-only. Sparse camera sets and p45/p58 morphology explain the tail more strongly than perturbation category or severity. The next step tests one local space-frequency representation that strictly contains v133 while preserving variable-camera and permutation invariance. No network is trained before capacity passes.",
